<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Verification Code</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f6f9;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3c72 0%, #2a5298 100%);
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 30px;
      color: #333333;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .otp-card {
      background: #f8fafc;
      border: 2px dashed #2a5298;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 25px 0;
    }
    .otp-code {
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 8px;
      color: #1e3c72;
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #718096;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Smart Parking System</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <h2>Hello, <%= name %>!</h2>
      <p>Thank you for choosing Smart Parking & Garage Management System. Use the verification code below to complete your authentication request:</p>
      
      <div class="otp-card">
        <div class="otp-code"><%= otpCode %></div>
      </div>
      
      <p>This verification code is valid for <strong><%= expiresMinutes %> minutes</strong>. Do not share this code with anyone.</p>
      <p>If you did not request this email, please ignore it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Smart Parking & Garage Management System. All rights reserved.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
